  ¬Becoming.«续无外» Becoming.TwoLines.step Becoming.«一» fun x => (true, 0, false)
Becoming.«族无外随网» : (Becoming.«族无外» Becoming.LineOfDescent.Endless.step Becoming.«一» fun x => (0, false)) ∧
